  "description": "<p>Are you looking to study at a university that keeps students and its syllabus up-to-date with industry trends?</p><p>Well-known for academic excellence and innovation, Berlin School of Business and Innovation offers industry-relevant programs emphasising practical business skills.</p><p><strong>About the University</strong></p><p>Berlin School of Business and Innovation (BSBI) was founded in 2014 by Global University Systems (GUS), one of Germany's popular universities.</p><p>BSBI offers undergraduate, postgraduate, doctorate, executive and professional education programs to learners around the world.&nbsp;</p><p>These courses include Digital Marketing, International Business and Management, Human Resources Management, Project Management, Artificial Intelligence, Logistics and Supply Chain Management, among many others.</p><p>BSBI also offers Professional Certificates in Corporate Sustainability &amp; Leadership, IoT for Business Management, and Project Management, to name a few.</p><p>Want to know more? Discover why the Berlin School of Business and Innovation might be the place for you!</p><p><strong>Why the Berlin School of Business and Innovation?</strong></p><ul><li>BSBI offers a wide range of courses and levels of study, in multiple fields of study for international students.</li><li>The university offers programs in German and English.</li><li>The university provides cultural immersion and exposure to students through its global student population.</li></ul><p><strong>Student Life</strong></p><p>BSBI’s friendly Student Council supports students with academics and extra-curricular activities and gives a multicultural and dynamic student body.</p><p>The main campus of BSBI is located in Berlin. The university also offers opportunities for students to study in Hamburg, Paris, Barcelona or Athens, through their academic partners - UNINETTUNO, UCA, and CUC.</p>",
