      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>Berlin School of Business and Innovation (BSBI) was founded in 2014 by Global University Systems (GUS), one of Germany's popular universities.</p><p>BSBI offers undergraduate, postgraduate, doctorate, executive and professional education programs to learners around the world.</p><p>These courses include Digital Marketing, International Business and Management, Human Resources Management, Project Management, Artificial Intelligence, Logistics and Supply Chain Management, among many others.</p><p>BSBI also offers Professional Certificates in Corporate Sustainability &amp; Leadership, IoT for Business Management, and Project Management, to name a few.</p><p>Want to know more? Discover why the Berlin School of Business and Innovation might be the place for you!</p>",
